    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A release... you think so? It feels like the only way to stop seeing them. Every time I close my eyes, I'm back in the mud, watching them die. If I'm still here, I'm just a ghost living a lie. Is there really no way back from this? Is there no path for a man who has lost his soul?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
